DESCRIPTION:River Wonders mở ~10:00.\nBé FREE dưới 3.\nNếu bé mệt → bỏ River\, về hotel nghỉ.\n15:00 Grab về Novotel.\n15:30–18:00 MANDATORY REST.
LOCATION:River Wonders\, Mandai
STATUS:CONFIRMED
